  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4671232025562bc3ba9a781319d633acf8cd8e78dc8e96912cd7564a7df4717d.png] \n\nOption 1) : 12 + 8 × 9 + (24 ÷ 5 + 8) - 7 = 35\n\nAfter interchanging the signs × and ÷ and the numbers 12 and 9 the equation is as follows : 9 + 8 ÷ 12 + (24 × 5 + 8) - 7 = 35\n\n⇒ 9 + 8 ÷ 12 + (__**24 × 5**__ + 8) - 7 = 35\n\n⇒ 9 + 8 ÷ 12 + __**(120 + 8)**__ - 7 = 35\n\n⇒ 9 + __**8 ÷ 12**__ + 128 - 7 = 35\n\n⇒ __**9 + 0.66 + 128**__ - 7 = 35\n\n⇒ __**137.66 - 7**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 130.66 ≠ 35\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) : 9 × 17 + 5 (24 ÷ 9) - 12 = 46\n\nAfter interchanging the signs × and ÷ and the numbers 12 and 9 the equation is as follows : 12 ÷ 17 + 5 (24 × 12) - 9 = 46\n\n⇒ 12 ÷ 17 + 5 __**(24 × 12)**__ - 9 = 46\n\n⇒ 12 ÷ 17 + __**5 (288)**__ - 9 = 46\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 17**__ + 1440 - 9 = 46\n\n⇒__** **____**0.705 + 1440**__ - 9 = 46\n\n⇒ __**1440.705 - 9**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 1431.705 ≠ 46\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : 14 ÷ 2 + 10 (12 - 6) × 9 = 37\n\nAfter interchanging the signs × and ÷ and the numbers 12 and 9 the equation is as follows : 14 × 2 + 10 (9 - 6) ÷ 12 = 37\n\n⇒ 14 × 2 + 10 __**(9 - 6)**__ ÷ 12 = 37\n\n⇒ 14 × 2 + __**10 (3)**__ ÷ 12 = 37\n\n⇒ 14 × 2 + __**30 ÷ 12**__ = 37\n\n⇒ __**14 × 2**__ + 2.5 = 37\n\n⇒ __**28 + 2.5**__ = 37\n\n⇒ 30.5 ≠ 37\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) : 10 + 2 ÷ 3 + (24 × 9 + 8) - 12 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs × and ÷ and the numbers 12 and 9 the equation is as follows : 10 + 2 × 3 + (24 ÷ 12 + 8) - 9 = 17\n\n⇒ 10 + 2 × 3 + (__**24 ÷ 12**__ + 8) - 9 = 17\n\n⇒ 10 + 2 × 3 + __**(2 + 8)**__ - 9 = 17\n\n⇒ 10 + __**2 × 3**__ + 10 - 9 = 17\n\n⇒ __**10 + 6 + 10**__ - 9 = 17\n\n⇒ __**26 - 9**__ = 17\n\n**⇒ 17 = 17**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"10 + 2 ÷ 3 + (24 × 9 + 8) - 12 = 17\".**",
